Update Mechanism: Manual

Description:
Simple Icons SVG geometry for brand identification in offline Agent renders.
See DISCLAIMER.md and the upstream simple-icons.json for per-brand terms.

Local Modifications:
Store the upstream slug, hex and SVG path in alphabetic ES module chunks.
Use tools/krypton/vendor_render_icons.py with the exact npm tarballs. Tarball,
license, disclaimer and metadata SHA-256 hashes are in
../icon-source-sha256.json and runtime file hashes are in ../sha256.json.
